{"id":"7f69e9730e0b4b31","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-enumeration-order-dependence.md","title":"同样的完成集合可以有不同流入集","display":"ex-enumeration-order-dependence — 同样的完成集合可以有不同流入集","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-enumeration-order-dependence","aliases":["20-ex-enumeration-order-dependence"],"display":"ex-enumeration-order-dependence — 同样的完成集合可以有不同流入集","chapter":"2","section":"2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definitions 2.6.3–2.6.4 的有限例子","source_printed_pages":[47,48],"source_pdf_pages":[83,84],"depends_on":["[[20-df-dynamic-differences]]","[[20-df-one-event-clock]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-enumeration-order-dependence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-enumeration-order-dependence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-enumeration-order-dependence — 同样的完成集合可以有不同流入集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 2.6.3–2.6.4 的有限例子"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>47</span><span>48</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>83</span><span>84</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9190004194115561\" href=\"?note=9190004194115561\" title=\"20-df-dynamic-differences\">20-df-dynamic-differences</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" href=\"?note=a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" title=\"20-df-one-event-clock\">20-df-one-event-clock</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec V=(V_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\">\\(\\vec V=(V_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\\)</span> 为集合序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_0=V_1=\\{0\\}\">\\(V_0=V_1=\\{0\\}\\)</span>，其余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e=\\varnothing\">\\(V_e=\\varnothing\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s\\in\\omega\">\\(e,s\\in\\omega\\)</span>，以二进制有限集代码定义全函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a(e,s)=\\begin{cases}1&amp;(e=0\\land s\\ge2)\\lor(e=1\\land s\\ge3),\\\\0&amp;\\text{其余};\\end{cases}\\quad\nb(e,s)=\\begin{cases}1&amp;(e=1\\land s\\ge2)\\lor(e=0\\land s\\ge3),\\\\0&amp;\\text{其余}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a(e,s)=\\begin{cases}1&amp;(e=0\\land s\\ge2)\\lor(e=1\\land s\\ge3),\\\\0&amp;\\text{其余};\\end{cases}\\quad\nb(e,s)=\\begin{cases}1&amp;(e=1\\land s\\ge2)\\lor(e=0\\land s\\ge3),\\\\0&amp;\\text{其余}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9190004194115561\" href=\"?note=9190004194115561\" title=\"20-df-dynamic-differences\">20-df-dynamic-differences</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" href=\"?note=a7fc9a5f08d87b69\" title=\"20-df-one-event-clock\">20-df-one-event-clock</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}order\\text{-}dependence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Clock}(a,\\vec V)\\land\\operatorname{Clock}(b,\\vec V)\\land\n\\operatorname{Flow}(a;0,1)=\\{0\\}\\land\\operatorname{Flow}(b;0,1)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}order\\text{-}dependence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Clock}(a,\\vec V)\\land\\operatorname{Clock}(b,\\vec V)\\land\n\\operatorname{Flow}(a;0,1)=\\{0\\}\\land\\operatorname{Flow}(b;0,1)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_1=\\{0\\}\">\\(D_1=\\{0\\}\\)</span>，代码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 表示空集。两函数都是普通全可计算函数；各列从空集单调增长，列号和元素均小于其进入阶段，每阶段至多新增一个配对事件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 在阶段 2 使第 0 列先含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、第 1 列尚空，所以记录此元素；阶段 3 它进入第 1 列，成为流入元素。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 中第 1 列先含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，所以第 0 列从未在它不属于第 1 列时含此元素。完成集合相同而动态算子不同，说明时钟是必要结构参数。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 2.6.3–2.6.4 的有限例子；印刷页 47, 48；PDF 第 83, 84 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-dynamic-differences","status":"resolved","id":"9190004194115561","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-dynamic-differences]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-event-clock","status":"resolved","id":"a7fc9a5f08d87b69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-one-event-clock]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dynamic-differences","status":"resolved","id":"9190004194115561","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dynamic-differences]]；see [[20-df-one-event-clock]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-event-clock","status":"resolved","id":"a7fc9a5f08d87b69","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dynamic-differences]]；see [[20-df-one-event-clock]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dynamic-differences]]；see [[20-df-one-event-clock]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-dynamic-differences]]；see [[20-df-one-event-clock]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vec V=(V_e)_{e\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"V_0=V_1=\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V_e=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"e,s\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a(e,s)=\\begin{cases}1&(e=0\\land s\\ge2)\\lor(e=1\\land s\\ge3),\\\\0&\\text{其余};\\end{cases}\\quad\nb(e,s)=\\begin{cases}1&(e=1\\land s\\ge2)\\lor(e=0\\land s\\ge3),\\\\0&\\text{其余}.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}enumeration\\text{-}order\\text{-}dependence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Clock}(a,\\vec V)\\land\\operatorname{Clock}(b,\\vec V)\\land\n\\operatorname{Flow}(a;0,1)=\\{0\\}\\land\\operatorname{Flow}(b;0,1)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"D_1=\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false}],"bytes":2119,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["9190004194115561","a7fc9a5f08d87b69","59004ac6d23e86f8","e343870c773cb68e"]}